      "side": 1,
      "message": "tuned it by eye tbh. turned off auto brightness, then checked the screen at 1/4, 1/2, 3/4 and full brightness when the FOD icon shows up to see if it got brighter, darker or stayed the same. wherever it got brighter i bumped the alpha up, then just interpolated the points in between",
